# T12.5d DATAFORM non-inference fixture. This source deliberately exhibits every surface a naive
# detector might (wrongly) read as a DATAFORM signal, yet it is NOT a pinned DATAFORM `.zi` artifact:
#   - **negative inline SAVE** (`8:00 -1:00 XYZ`) — the "vanguard-looking" feature; mainline 2026b
#     already uses negative SAVE, so "negative SAVE ⇒ vanguard" is provably wrong (law 7);
#   - **DST rules + a rich transition stream** (output shape);
#   - a **`Backzone/`-suggestive zone name** (names prove nothing);
#   - a **Link** (alias/link counts prove nothing).
# zic-rs must leave `source_profile.dataform_evidence` at `unknown_no_evidence`: detection is
# hash-backed against the pinned artifacts only, never inferred from any of the above.
Zone Test/NegSave	8:00	-1:00	XYZ
Rule N 2020 only - Mar Sun>=8 2:00 1:00 D
Rule N 2020 only - Nov Sun>=1 2:00 0 S
Zone Test/Dst	-5:00	N	E%sT
Zone Backzone/Looking	0	-	LOOK
Link Test/Dst	Test/Alias
